    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061205.0189\n\nFRANKFURT, Dec 5 , 2006, 2006\n\nGerman new car registrations up in November\n\n\n\n\nAutomobile sales in Germany rose sharply in November, reinforcing expectations for full-year growth, the VDA auto industry federation said on Tuesday.\n\nThe number of new car registrations -- a key yardstick of domestic demand in the sector -- jumped by 18 percent to 326,000 vehicles last month, VDA said in a statement.\n\nAnd that put the industry on target for a three-percent rise in sales to 3.4 million vehicles for the whole of 2006, the VDA said.",
